. <br>The phrases you use to talk to a friend are not the same as the phrases you use to talk to your boss.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"05\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Formal</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Informal</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Making a call</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hello, this is (name) from (company).</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hey, it's (name).</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Answering the Call</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">This is (name) speaking.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Asking for Somebody</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">May/Can I speak to (name), please?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Is (name) there?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Reason for Calling</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm calling about/to ... </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Just calling about ...<br>Just calling to ... </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " The Modal Can for Possibility ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The modal<span class=\"strong\"> can</span> is used to ask and say what is possible.  The negative form is<span class=\"strong\"> can't</span>. They go before a verb in the base form.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I can come on Wednesday.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I can't come tomorrow. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "After a question, you do not need to repeat the information in the sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Mr. Martin</span>:  Can you come on Tuesday at 2:00?<br /> <span class=\"strong\"> Carla</span>:   Yes, I can./No, I can't.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to set up ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make the arrangements needed for something to happen ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm calling to set up an interview.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when setting up an interview. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "job interview ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a meeting where you answer questions to see if you are the right person for a job ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would like to set up a job interview.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "slot ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a short period of time for a specific event ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Is there a slot in the morning?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"con